      "id": "BugsRadar",
      "range": "[3.0.0.2, )"
    },
    "message": "Superseded by BugsRadar 3.0.0.2, which removes SendAsync and SendExceptionAsync: they waited for delivery, so awaiting one in a catch block added a network round trip to your code. Use Send, SendException and FlushAsync. Install 3.0.0.2 or later.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Project errors monitoring in real time: direct calls, ILogger provider and Serilog sink in one package",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "BugsRadar",
  "isPrerelease": false,
